            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In response to your story about working long shifts without a break, food or a glass of water (news, 25 January), we used to have 'hydration stations' to keep our water bottles in. However, last year the matron removed them and gave us an extra 10-minute tea break.</AbstractText>
